title: "Do Rich Countries Invest More in Saving the Planet? Analysis of Europe’s Green Investment Landscape"
abstract: >-
  Analysis of environmental protection investments across EU countries
  (2014-2022) using Eurostat data. The project examines the relationship
  between national wealth (GDP per capita) and per-capita environmental
  protection investment via exploratory analysis, clustering, and predictive
  modelling (linear regression and random forest), and is developed as a
  fully FAIR open-science experiment for the TU Wien Data Stewardship
  course (194.045).
